                         "task_name":  "5 mm evaporator Haipin Tube tab and scratch problem troubleshooting- Vertical expander machine",
                         "task_details":  "1. Locate and identify defective hairpin tubes with tab and scratch \n2. Manually operate the machine step by step to identify at which exact step the defects are occurring\n3. Check and compare tube quality from different tube suppliers to identify material related issues\n4. Inspect and identify defective receivers causing tab and scratch on 5mm evaporator hairpin tubes\n5. Change receiver position and re-align \n6. Replace defective receivers with new receivers \n7. Inspect expanding rods and bullets for wear, damage, and dimensional accuracy\n8. Clean base die thoroughly to remove burrs, debris\n9. Adjust air pressure settings for trial purpose \n10. Run trial with new receivers and adjusted settings, inspect tube surface quality\n11. Repair defective receivers and conduct trial to verify improvement\n12. Confirm tab and scratch defects resolved and release for production",
